      "name": "Is a CE marked consumable accepted in Saudi Arabia?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Not automatically. The Saudi Food and Drug Authority runs its own process, and approval elsewhere may support an application without replacing it. Establish what the destination market requires before selecting a supplier."
